<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>ECI Suite — Panel de Mercado</title>
<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: dark;
    --bg: #0a0e18; --bg-soft: #0d1322; --surface: #111a2e; --surface-2: #0e1626;
    --border: rgba(255,255,255,.08); --border-strong: rgba(255,255,255,.16);
    --text: #e7ecf7; --muted: #8b92a8; --muted-2: #5f6780;
    --accent: #2dd4ee; --accent-soft: rgba(45,212,238,.12);
    --gold: #eaa63e; --good: #34d399; --good-bg: rgba(52,211,153,.12);
    --tag-bg: rgba(255,255,255,.05); --tag-text: #b7bed2;
    --shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.5; }
  a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }

  .topbar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .8rem; padding: 1rem 1.6rem; background: var(--bg-soft); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .logo { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 10px; flex: none; background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, var(--gold), #7a4e12); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.3rem; box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.08), 0 4px 12px rgba(234,166,62,.25); }
  .brand-name { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  .brand-sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: .78rem; }

  .hero { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2.2rem 1.6rem 1rem; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: 1.9rem; margin: 0 0 .4rem; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  .hero p { color: var(--muted); max-width: 640px; margin: 0; font-size: .95rem; }

  .cta-row { max-width: 1180px; margin: 1.4rem auto 2rem; padding: 0 1.6rem; }
  .cta-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(234,166,62,.14), rgba(45,212,238,.08));
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong); border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.4rem 1.6rem;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .cta-card h2 { margin: 0 0 .3rem; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  .cta-card p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .88rem; max-width: 480px; }
  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--gold); color: #201400; font-weight: 700; padding: .7rem 1.3rem;
    border-radius: 10px; font-size: .92rem; white-space: nowrap;
  }

  main { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.6rem 4rem; }
  .section-label { font-size: .78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .05em; color: var(--muted-2); margin: 0 0 .9rem; }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
  .niche-card {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.2rem 1.3rem; box-shadow: var(--shadow); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .7rem;
  }
  .niche-card h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .niche-stats { display: flex; gap: .5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .stat-pill { background: var(--tag-bg); color: var(--tag-text); border-radius: 999px; padding: .25rem .7rem; font-size: .78rem; }
  .stat-pill b { color: var(--text); }
  .niche-card .no-data { color: var(--muted-2); font-size: .85rem; font-style: italic; }
  .niche-actions { display: flex; gap: .6rem; margin-top: auto; }
  .btn { flex: 1; text-align: center; padding: .5rem .7rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: .84rem; font-weight: 600; background: var(--accent); color: #06222b; }
  .btn.secondary { background: var(--tag-bg); color: var(--text); border: 1px solid var(--border); }

  footer { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; color: var(--muted-2); font-size: .8rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar">
  <div class="logo">📡</div>
  <div>
    <div class="brand-name">ECI Suite</div>
    <div class="brand-sub">Ecommerce Creative Intelligence · Panel de Mercado</div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="hero">
  <h1>¿Qué se está moviendo en el mercado?</h1>
  <p>Panel en vivo por nicho y subnicho — marcas referentes, formatos y patrones creativos que ya están funcionando en Meta Ads, más un motor de viabilidad para analizar un producto nuevo antes de pautarlo.</p>
</div>

<div class="cta-row">
  <div class="cta-card">
    <div>
      <h2>🧪 Analizar un producto nuevo</h2>
      <p>Describí el producto, tu costo y tu precio de venta — el sistema busca competidores reales, un rango de precios de mercado y te da un veredicto de viabilidad.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn-primary" href="/producto">Analizar producto →</a>
  </div>
</div>

<main>
  <p class="section-label">Nichos investigados — {{ niches | length }}</p>
  <div class="grid">
    {% for n in niches %}
    <div class="niche-card">
      <h3>{{ n.label }}</h3>
      {% if n.has_data %}
      <div class="niche-stats">
        <span class="stat-pill"><b>{{ n.total_advertisers }}</b> marcas investigadas</span>
        <span class="stat-pill"><b>{{ n.scale_alta_count }}</b> a escala alta (50+)</span>
        <span class="stat-pill"><b>{{ n.markets | length }}</b> mercado{{ 's' if n.markets|length != 1 else '' }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="niche-actions">
        <a class="btn" href="{{ n.href }}">Ver panel del nicho →</a>
      </div>
      {% else %}
      <p class="no-data">Sin datos investigados todavía — corré <code>eci research --niche {{ n.code|lower }}</code>.</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</main>

<footer>
  ECI Suite · Datos desde Meta Ad Library en vivo · Señales de presencia publicitaria observable, no de ventas ni rentabilidad.
</footer>
</body>
</html>
